WEBVTT

00:02.950 --> 00:05.950
<b>Day three already... it's going so fast.</b>

00:05.950 --> 00:06.830
<b>Yeah.</b>

00:07.000 --> 00:08.500
<b>Sure you're not tired, Nono-pi?</b>

00:08.500 --> 00:11.580
<b>I'll be fine since we're not cosplaying today.</b>

00:11.580 --> 00:13.000
<b>I'm just here for Senpai.</b>

00:13.000 --> 00:14.540
<b>As long as you're all okay.</b>

00:17.370 --> 00:18.870
<b>Okay, Okumura.</b>

00:19.080 --> 00:22.580
<b>I'm busy on Day Three,
so I won't be joining you,</b>

00:22.580 --> 00:25.330
<b>but as the Cosplay Club advisor,
I need to give you a word of advice.</b>

00:25.500 --> 00:27.250
<b>We're the Manga Club, Sensei.</b>

00:27.620 --> 00:30.040
<b>If you're going,
there's one cosplayer you have to go see.</b>

00:30.040 --> 00:30.950
<b>Really?</b>

00:30.950 --> 00:34.580
<b>Right! I wanted to get a copy of her cosrom.</b>

00:35.450 --> 00:36.250
<b>Okay, let's go! Where to first?</b>

00:36.250 --> 00:39.540
<b>Okay, let's go! Where to first?
If Sensei was that insistent, she's gotta be big...</b>

00:39.540 --> 00:42.250
<b>Wait, Senpai, is that the same hat?</b>

00:42.830 --> 00:46.250
<b>Nope, the one Sensei signed
is too precious to wear now!</b>

00:46.250 --> 00:48.580
<b>I'm wearing the extra one I bought just in case.</b>

00:48.580 --> 00:51.080
<b>Didn't he say they only made ten of those?</b>

00:51.080 --> 00:54.620
<b>Wait, Aria-chan,
I thought you were supposed to visit family today.</b>

00:54.620 --> 00:56.790
<b>Yeah, that was the plan,</b>

00:57.830 --> 00:59.500
<b>but we're going tomorrow instead.</b>

01:11.620 --> 01:12.870
<b>You got old.</b>

01:14.660 --> 01:18.620
<b>C'mon, let's go! Ririsa's got stuff to buy!</b>

01:19.250 --> 01:20.290
<b>Okay!</b>

02:51.040 --> 02:56.000
<b>This Wonderful World</b>

02:59.500 --> 03:01.950
<b>Hey there, Liliel gang!</b>

03:01.950 --> 03:05.290
<b>I heard about what happened.
Great job yesterday!</b>

03:05.290 --> 03:09.040
<b>Thank you so much!
Can I get your new cosrom, please?</b>

03:09.040 --> 03:12.290
<b>Of course! This one's for all ages.</b>

03:12.290 --> 03:14.000
<b>Oh, you don't need to pay.</b>

03:14.000 --> 03:14.580
<b>Huh?</b>

03:14.580 --> 03:15.700
<b>Ogino, that's 2000 yen.</b>

03:15.700 --> 03:18.540
<b>I take it I'll be purchasing it for you, then?</b>

03:19.250 --> 03:23.910
<b>Just get me a copy of your new cosrom.
We'll call it a trade!</b>

03:24.870 --> 03:25.910
<b>Sounds great!</b>

03:29.750 --> 03:32.500
<b>Hi, Liliel-chan! Long time no see!</b>

03:32.830 --> 03:35.290
<b>I saw you online! So glad you're okay.</b>

03:35.290 --> 03:37.750
<b>Thanks! Sorry to cause so much drama.</b>

03:37.950 --> 03:39.450
<b>Can I buy your new cosrom?</b>

03:40.620 --> 03:43.200
<b>That'll be 2000 yen for the full set.</b>

03:44.580 --> 03:48.700
<b>I'm busy on Day Three. I'm busy on Day Three.</b>

03:50.500 --> 03:51.580
<b>Sensei?</b>

03:52.040 --> 03:56.290
<b>Hey, I'm on a date!
This is my day off, so who cares?!</b>

03:56.290 --> 03:58.580
<b>Eri needed help at the booth, okay?
Can't say no to a date, right?</b>

03:58.790 --> 04:02.200
<b>Sorry, kids, but I get to play with Mayuri-sensei today.</b>

04:02.200 --> 04:03.910
<b>Don't make it sound dirty!</b>

04:03.910 --> 04:08.040
<b>After this, we're going to that one café
that has god-tier service just for Comiket,</b>

04:08.040 --> 04:10.910
<b>then a karaoke after party,
then a cosplay rave.</b>

04:10.910 --> 04:11.910
<b>Nothing dirty happening here!</b>

04:11.910 --> 04:14.200
<b>Mayuri, these kids won't know what a cosplay rave is.</b>

04:14.950 --> 04:15.870
<b>Oh, right.</b>

04:15.870 --> 04:18.500
<b>The cosrom you're looking for is over at that booth.</b>

04:18.500 --> 04:20.370
<b>There's no line right now.</b>

04:20.370 --> 04:21.370
<b>Really?</b>

04:21.370 --> 04:24.450
<b>Is that the cosplayer you
wanted to see, Ririsa-chan?</b>

04:24.450 --> 04:25.290
<b>Yeah!</b>

04:25.500 --> 04:30.750
<b>She spends a whole year making her
costume and sculpting her body for a character,</b>

04:30.750 --> 04:33.000
<b>so we only see her once
a year at Summer Comiket.</b>

04:33.000 --> 04:34.750
<b>Five-star rarity, then.</b>

04:35.450 --> 04:37.250
<b>If Ririsa's this excited...</b>

04:37.250 --> 04:38.910
<b>Then what's she like?</b>

04:39.450 --> 04:41.120
<b>One copy of your newest release!</b>

04:41.120 --> 04:42.200
<b>Okay!</b>

04:42.620 --> 04:45.290
<b>That'll be 5000 yen for the set.</b>

04:47.410 --> 04:49.950
<b>I like the costume, but what cosplay is that?</b>

04:50.160 --> 04:52.330
<b>Oh, I'm just helping out!</b>

04:52.660 --> 04:56.160
<b>She's up on the roof getting photos taken right now.</b>

04:56.160 --> 04:57.200
<b>Well, well!</b>

04:57.950 --> 04:59.750
<b>If it isn't Liliel!</b>

04:59.750 --> 05:01.910
<b>You're Nyaru-chan from NekoConnect!</b>

05:01.910 --> 05:04.620
<b>Are you just getting finished with photos?</b>

05:04.620 --> 05:06.750
<b>Yup, sorry!</b>

05:07.040 --> 05:10.080
<b>But, I wouldn't mind sticking around
if Kai-sama wanted a few shots!</b>

05:10.410 --> 05:11.500
<b>I'm good.</b>

05:11.500 --> 05:13.370
<b>Things are chaotic enough up here as it is.</b>

05:13.370 --> 05:16.120
<b>That's so something the broody
Kai-sama would've said at the start of his arc!</b>

05:16.120 --> 05:17.500
<b>That's okay.</b>

05:17.500 --> 05:21.290
<b>I gotta play the game right and keep
talking to him every time he shows up!</b>

05:21.290 --> 05:22.580
<b>Who is she?!</b>

05:22.580 --> 05:25.200
<b>And why is she looking at him like that?!
I'll show her!</b>

05:25.200 --> 05:27.160
<b>Everyone's such good friends.</b>

05:28.250 --> 05:30.410
<b>Hey, that's her new cosrom.</b>

05:30.790 --> 05:32.040
<b>Y-yeah.</b>

05:32.410 --> 05:35.040
<b>You can find her beyond that crowd over there.</b>

05:35.040 --> 05:37.950
<b>Though my crowd was totally bigger than hers!</b>

05:38.950 --> 05:40.080
<b>I mean...</b>

05:40.450 --> 05:45.700
<b>She doesn't care that much about
drawing big crowds or selling tons of cosroms.</b>

05:46.410 --> 05:48.160
<b>She's just dedicated...</b>

05:49.000 --> 05:50.790
<b>...to the art of cosplay.</b>

05:52.790 --> 05:53.910
<b>Hey, Mayura.</b>

05:54.870 --> 05:58.410
<b>Were you guys talking about the Heavenly Queen?</b>

05:58.410 --> 05:59.370
<b>Yeah.</b>

05:59.370 --> 06:05.790
<b>I want Ririsa and the gang to see
her as what they should aspire towards.</b>

06:06.580 --> 06:08.910
<b>Because she's not interested in popularity.</b>

06:11.500 --> 06:14.330
<b>She's all about defining cosplay as an art form.</b>

06:14.500 --> 06:15.660
<b>Erika-chan!</b>

06:15.660 --> 06:19.250
<b>Photographers might think Nagomi's
the best cosplayer out there...</b>

06:20.120 --> 06:23.160
<b>But, cosplayers would choose her instead.</b>

06:23.660 --> 06:27.000
<b>She's the closest anyone's gotten to being truly 2D.</b>

06:28.500 --> 06:31.290
<b>Heavenly Queen Erika Awayuki.</b>

06:33.370 --> 06:34.620
<b>Wow.</b>

06:34.950 --> 06:41.250
<b>The costume, the wig, the details and props,
even the shape of her body,</b>

06:41.250 --> 06:44.290
<b>everything is a perfect replica of the original!</b>

06:44.290 --> 06:47.870
<b>I didn't think this precision was humanly possible!</b>

06:48.080 --> 06:54.160
<b>I put tons of work into being the best Liliel,
but I'm nowhere close to looking like the original!</b>

06:54.160 --> 06:57.950
<b>Liliel's arms and waist are way slimmer,
and her boobs are bigger!</b>

06:57.950 --> 06:59.120
<b>Well, yeah...</b>

07:00.660 --> 07:02.120
<b>I'm not even close.</b>

07:02.120 --> 07:04.160
<b>How do I get to her level?!</b>

07:04.750 --> 07:06.450
<b>I can't believe I thought I looked good!</b>

07:06.450 --> 07:09.160
<b>I still have so much more to improve upon!</b>

07:09.160 --> 07:11.750
<b>You're already really good.</b>

07:14.250 --> 07:16.500
<b>I got our application form for Winter Comiket!</b>

07:17.910 --> 07:20.290
<b>I'm gonna put together a cosrom and sell it there!</b>

07:20.580 --> 07:22.790
<b>I can't wait to do this again with you!</b>

07:26.620 --> 07:30.000
<b>You already got what you came for, huh?</b>

07:30.450 --> 07:33.040
<b>You don't really have a reason to keep cosplaying.</b>

07:35.700 --> 07:37.450
<b>I guess that's true.</b>

07:39.250 --> 07:41.160
<b>But, is that what you want, Nono-pi?</b>

07:41.160 --> 07:43.870
<b>For me to stop cosplaying with you?</b>

07:43.870 --> 07:46.120
<b>Huh?! I mean, why ask me...</b>

07:48.370 --> 07:50.160
<b>Guess I'm done, then.</b>

07:50.160 --> 07:51.830
<b>Wait, no!</b>

07:54.040 --> 07:58.410
<b>You told Ririsa how you feel. Now tell me.</b>

07:59.660 --> 08:00.910
<b>I...</b>

08:06.580 --> 08:11.000
<b>I don't want you to stop!
I thought we were friends!</b>

08:14.620 --> 08:15.700
<b>Ririsa.</b>

08:16.660 --> 08:19.160
<b>I'm not gonna stop.</b>

08:19.160 --> 08:23.540
<b>Not when I had so much fun cosplaying with you guys!</b>

08:24.370 --> 08:25.700
<b>Yay!</b>

08:25.700 --> 08:29.000
<b>I can't wait to cosplay with you again, Aria-chan!</b>

08:29.200 --> 08:30.450
<b>No fair!</b>

08:30.450 --> 08:32.910
<b>You were gonna keep cosplaying
no matter what I said!</b>

08:34.200 --> 08:36.620
<b>You're not getting rid of me yet, Nono-pi!</b>

08:39.660 --> 08:41.870
<b>Like I care!
We're stuck together forever!</b>

08:41.870 --> 08:43.500
<b>We're stuck together forever!</b>

08:49.200 --> 08:50.330
<b>It's from Mom.</b>

08:50.450 --> 08:52.120
<b>Remember this place?</b>

08:59.040 --> 09:00.620
<b>So your parents are cool?</b>

09:00.620 --> 09:03.870
<b>Yeah. Oh, and Dad made his deadline.</b>

09:06.040 --> 09:07.450
<b>I can't thank you guys enough!</b>

09:07.950 --> 09:11.120
<b>Please, it was mostly Senpai!</b>

09:11.910 --> 09:12.830
<b>Yeah.</b>

09:15.620 --> 09:20.080
<b>The manga you made,
the manga you created, made me happy!</b>

09:20.500 --> 09:24.250
<b>I couldn't have done it without you, Okumura.</b>

09:32.040 --> 09:33.160
<b>Thank you.</b>

09:33.660 --> 09:35.620
<b>Y-you're welcome.</b>

09:35.620 --> 09:38.000
<b>Don't tell me I've got even more competition!</b>

09:38.000 --> 09:40.450
<b>I'm so glad we're all such good friends.</b>

09:42.790 --> 09:46.080
<b>Okay, who's ready for Day Four tomorrow?!</b>

09:46.080 --> 09:47.450
<b>I have work!</b>

09:47.450 --> 09:48.500
<b>I'm out of town.</b>

09:48.500 --> 09:50.830
<b>Could I please sleep in, Ririsa-chan?</b>

09:58.040 --> 10:00.250
<b>Good morning, Senpai!</b>

10:03.450 --> 10:04.870
<b>H-hey.</b>

10:05.120 --> 10:07.000
<b>Just me and Ririsa today.</b>

10:07.000 --> 10:10.160
<b>Reminds me of the first time we went to an event.</b>

10:10.540 --> 10:12.370
<b>I can't believe it's the last day!</b>

10:12.370 --> 10:13.330
<b>Yeah.</b>

10:15.410 --> 10:18.370
<b>It's been a while since it's been just the two of us, huh?</b>

10:18.370 --> 10:20.500
<b>Oh, y-yeah, huh.</b>

10:20.950 --> 10:22.660
<b>Hey, we're on a date!</b>

10:23.870 --> 10:26.910
<b>Wait, this is totally a Comiket date!</b>

10:27.250 --> 10:31.450
<b>Why does my heart start racing
whenever I'm alone with him?</b>

10:31.950 --> 10:36.370
<b>I mean, I love Senpai, but not like that!
He's just a friend!</b>

10:36.950 --> 10:38.540
<b>Look, it'll be fine.</b>

10:38.540 --> 10:42.000
<b>Our first event felt like a date,
but we got through it.</b>

10:42.250 --> 10:43.250
<b>No need to freak out.</b>

10:43.700 --> 10:47.370
<b>Wait, what's with the suitcase?</b>

10:47.370 --> 10:50.370
<b>Oh! I brought something to
change into once we get there.</b>

10:50.370 --> 10:51.000
<b>Huh?</b>

10:54.580 --> 10:56.250
<b>Thanks for waiting!</b>

10:58.620 --> 11:04.700
<b>Ever since my first Comiket,
I've wanted to shop the floor in costume!</b>

11:05.620 --> 11:10.160
<b>I didn't have the courage to do it alone,
but with you, I thought...</b>

11:11.410 --> 11:13.250
<b>Oh, I'm in trouble.</b>

11:13.250 --> 11:14.580
<b>Look, Liliel!</b>

11:14.830 --> 11:16.450
<b>Wait, is that the one cosplayer?</b>

11:20.290 --> 11:25.290
<b>Wait, Liliel...
Aren't people going to think we're like, together?</b>

11:25.290 --> 11:29.450
<b>Cosplayers can have boyfriends! We're not idols.</b>

11:29.450 --> 11:33.040
<b>Wow. I didn't expect you to have
an immediate counter for that.</b>

11:33.370 --> 11:34.620
<b>I mean...</b>

11:36.290 --> 11:40.580
<b>I kinda wouldn't mind if people
thought we were together.</b>

11:41.750 --> 11:44.750
<b>What the hell is that supposed to mean, Liliel?!</b>

11:44.750 --> 11:45.330
<b>Still...</b>

11:46.500 --> 11:49.250
<b>I thought that might weird you out.</b>

11:49.660 --> 11:52.580
<b>No, it's totally fine...</b>

11:54.410 --> 11:55.910
<b>So I brought this for you!</b>

12:02.450 --> 12:05.120
<b>Liliel... When did you make this?</b>

12:05.540 --> 12:10.080
<b>I knew you'd make a great Ashford-sama!
You could totally be the next Heavenly King!</b>

12:10.080 --> 12:11.160
<b>I'll pass, thanks.</b>

12:11.870 --> 12:15.250
<b>Look, Ash and Liliel!
Their costumes are so good!</b>

12:18.660 --> 12:22.450
<b>You're right. We're not a couple,
we're just a cosplay group.</b>

12:22.450 --> 12:24.330
<b>That'll make walking around less awkward!</b>

12:24.830 --> 12:25.910
<b>Can I buy a copy?</b>

12:25.910 --> 12:27.290
<b>Of course! That'll be 800 yen.</b>

12:27.290 --> 12:32.580
<b>I knew when I got back into
AshLili that it's pretty obscure now,</b>

12:32.580 --> 12:35.040
<b>but I thought I'd sell at least one copy...</b>

12:35.250 --> 12:38.790
<b>I should've just done something for
Hellmaids like everyone else...</b>

12:38.790 --> 12:39.950
<b>Excuse me!</b>

12:41.120 --> 12:43.910
<b>Might I take a look through your book?</b>

12:45.500 --> 12:46.830
<b>Y-y-yeah, sure!</b>

12:46.830 --> 12:49.080
<b>Liliel and Ash-sama!</b>

12:49.080 --> 12:51.000
<b>Here, in the flesh, at my booth!</b>

12:51.120 --> 12:54.620
<b>They're so freaking cute! Is this real life?!</b>

12:54.910 --> 12:57.120
<b>Oh, look, Ash-sama!</b>

12:57.120 --> 13:01.160
<b>Tales of our adventures sure have traveled far!</b>

13:01.410 --> 13:05.120
<b>I did not expect to find a
picture book exposition here.</b>

13:05.120 --> 13:07.750
<b>Always interesting, these port towns.</b>

13:07.750 --> 13:10.410
<b>They're in character on an adventure!</b>

13:10.950 --> 13:14.870
<b>This book tells the story of our romance.</b>

13:15.080 --> 13:16.250
<b>Oh, goodness.</b>

13:16.580 --> 13:19.370
<b>And they're totally flirting! I love them so much!</b>

13:19.700 --> 13:22.120
<b>May I have a copy?</b>

13:22.120 --> 13:24.830
<b>One for me too, madam.</b>

13:24.830 --> 13:27.160
<b>Of course! It's free for you!</b>

13:27.160 --> 13:29.290
<b>It's all right, we'll pay!</b>

13:29.580 --> 13:30.870
<b>Please, don't!</b>

13:30.870 --> 13:37.120
<b>I mean, I saw a Liliel cosplay, uh,
a photo of you, online back in May.</b>

13:37.660 --> 13:42.830
<b>And that's what inspired me to draw this.
I did it for the fandom, you know?</b>

13:43.160 --> 13:45.080
<b>So you don't need to pay.</b>

13:45.080 --> 13:48.200
<b>Consider this a trade.</b>

13:50.410 --> 13:51.830
<b>Thank you so much!</b>

14:07.160 --> 14:10.700
<b>I felt so connected with the Liliel fandom today!</b>

14:10.950 --> 14:12.000
<b>Me too.</b>

14:12.330 --> 14:14.910
<b>Everyone was so happy to see Liliel.</b>

14:15.410 --> 14:17.040
<b>Wait, really?!</b>

14:17.200 --> 14:18.080
<b>Yeah.</b>

14:20.200 --> 14:24.830
<b>Most of the time, we're either studying for school,
or geeking out about anime and manga.</b>

14:24.830 --> 14:30.120
<b>It's not every day we get the opportunity
to make other people happy like you did.</b>

14:30.790 --> 14:32.370
<b>You're amazing,</b>

14:33.080 --> 14:34.160
<b>Ririsa.</b>

14:38.120 --> 14:41.290
<b>Oh, sorry! It felt right in the moment,
I just didn't think!</b>

14:41.290 --> 14:42.330
<b>It's okay!</b>

14:43.410 --> 14:45.910
<b>Y-you're amazing, Senpai.</b>

14:47.120 --> 14:51.410
<b>I just cosplay because I think it's cool.</b>

14:52.080 --> 14:55.620
<b>You're the one who accepted
me without any judgment.</b>

14:56.370 --> 14:59.540
<b>And I only started cosplaying because of you.</b>

15:00.660 --> 15:03.040
<b>Together, we'll make it happen!</b>

15:03.620 --> 15:06.000
<b>I made my first cosrom because of you.</b>

15:07.080 --> 15:08.500
<b>I'll be there for you!</b>

15:08.500 --> 15:12.500
<b>When I was about to give up,
you gave me the strength to keep going.</b>

15:14.330 --> 15:18.200
<b>I'd be nothing without you.</b>

15:19.200 --> 15:24.250
<b>You're the reason I'm so amazing. It's you.</b>

15:35.290 --> 15:39.290
<b>I can't help it. I love him so much.</b>

15:40.000 --> 15:42.540
<b>Is it because he's Ash-sama right now?</b>

15:43.330 --> 15:46.080
<b>I can't think of him like this.</b>

15:47.370 --> 15:51.410
<b>Maybe I don't like him as just a friend.
Maybe it's...</b>

15:53.410 --> 15:54.330
<b>Lo...</b>

15:59.450 --> 16:00.330
<b>Hey!</b>

16:00.330 --> 16:01.700
<b>You dropped part of your costume!</b>

16:02.580 --> 16:04.080
<b>Wait, is this yours?</b>

16:04.080 --> 16:06.790
<b>No, I have mine.</b>

16:06.790 --> 16:07.910
<b>Thank you!</b>

16:13.370 --> 16:15.660
<b>Ashford-sama?</b>

16:17.870 --> 16:18.950
<b>Liliel?</b>

16:20.200 --> 16:21.410
<b>One moment, please!</b>

16:21.790 --> 16:25.330
<b>This is my first time in Japan.
This is my first time...</b>

16:25.620 --> 16:26.580
<b>Okay!</b>

16:29.540 --> 16:34.450
<b>My name is Xiaoyu! I'm a cosplayer,
and this is my first time in Japan!</b>

16:35.580 --> 16:36.830
<b>You came all the way here?!</b>

16:36.830 --> 16:40.700
<b>Lots of people travel to come to Comiket!
It's famous!</b>

16:41.040 --> 16:43.120
<b>And we all love Japanese manga!</b>

16:44.250 --> 16:47.750
<b>I'm so excited! I've never met another Liliel fan!</b>

16:47.750 --> 16:51.830
<b>I'm excited, too!
It's so cool that Liliel has fans outside Japan, too!</b>

16:51.830 --> 16:56.910
<b>This is the Side Story outfit! It's so cute.
I love the bare shoulders!</b>

16:56.910 --> 17:00.250
<b>I love the thicker material on her original outfit!
Did you make it yourself?</b>

17:00.250 --> 17:01.250
<b>Yes, I did!</b>

17:01.250 --> 17:05.450
<b>The joy of finding a fellow otaku
crosses all languages and borders.</b>

17:06.410 --> 17:10.540
<b>This is a once-in-a-lifetime chance!
Can we take some pictures together?!</b>

17:10.540 --> 17:12.000
<b>Absolutely!</b>

17:12.750 --> 17:16.290
<b>Wouldn't that be against canon, Ririsa?
There's never two Liliels.</b>

17:16.290 --> 17:19.410
<b>You're right, that's never happened in canon!</b>

17:20.290 --> 17:24.700
<b>What do you think?
Two Liliels will make some really fun photos!</b>

17:28.660 --> 17:29.700
<b>Let's do it!</b>

17:29.950 --> 17:30.950
<b>Ririsa?</b>

17:31.450 --> 17:35.500
<b>The other day, I got so caught up with
staying in character that I passed out.</b>

17:35.500 --> 17:40.620
<b>But, the whole reason I like staying in
character is because that's more fun for me.</b>

17:41.160 --> 17:44.540
<b>I'm not going to be a stickler if it ruins that fun!</b>

17:45.290 --> 17:49.160
<b>It's not worth it if it makes me miss
out on a once-in-a-lifetime chance!</b>

17:50.330 --> 17:52.250
<b>Let's go, Xiaoyu-chan!</b>

17:52.250 --> 17:54.790
<b>Okay, then let's go up to the photo area!</b>

17:54.790 --> 17:56.870
<b>Cool. I'll go do my own thing.</b>

17:56.870 --> 17:59.370
<b>You have to come with us, Ashford-sama!</b>

18:01.120 --> 18:02.040
<b>Huh?</b>

18:04.040 --> 18:07.790
<b>Boy, that takes me back! Lord Ashford and...</b>

18:08.120 --> 18:09.580
<b>Two Liliels?</b>

18:09.830 --> 18:11.290
<b>That's that one Liliel.</b>

18:11.290 --> 18:11.950
<b>Wow, you're famous!</b>

18:11.950 --> 18:13.910
<b>Liliel-chan!
Wow, you're famous!</b>

18:13.910 --> 18:15.750
<b>Everyone rushed in to get pictures!</b>

18:15.910 --> 18:18.750
<b>Never guessed I'd be doing this today...</b>

18:19.080 --> 18:22.910
<b>But, refusing would be an insult to Liliel.</b>

18:34.160 --> 18:35.700
<b>Senpai's into it!</b>

18:35.950 --> 18:41.700
<b>Someone here taught me that cosplay
is nothing to be embarrassed about.</b>

18:41.870 --> 18:45.120
<b>Ash-sama and Liliel would totally go like this!</b>

18:47.410 --> 18:50.500
<b>S-senpai's with another Liliel?!</b>

18:51.200 --> 18:53.540
<b>Why does it feel so wrong?!</b>

18:54.540 --> 18:55.700
<b>Ririsa?!</b>

19:00.040 --> 19:03.540
<b>Wait, is she jealous?!
Are you jealous, Ririsa?!</b>

19:04.700 --> 19:07.870
<b>Are the two Liliels fighting over Ash?</b>

19:07.870 --> 19:10.500
<b>Did that ever happen in the manga?</b>

19:10.500 --> 19:12.830
<b>That's a bit out of character.</b>

19:13.250 --> 19:14.700
<b>It's a deep cut.</b>

19:14.700 --> 19:20.290
<b>It must be a metaphor for how Liliel feels
torn between duty and her love for Ash.</b>

19:20.290 --> 19:24.370
<b>One's wearing her original costume,
the other is wearing her spin-off costume.</b>

19:24.370 --> 19:27.500
<b>Never have I seen such an advanced
expression of fandom through cosplay!</b>

19:27.500 --> 19:29.040
<b>That's so smart.</b>

19:29.040 --> 19:30.290
<b>That's gotta be it.</b>

19:30.290 --> 19:31.370
<b>That's our Liliel!</b>

19:31.370 --> 19:32.580
<b>Stellar work.</b>

19:38.500 --> 19:41.000
<b>Thank you! I had so much fun today!</b>

19:41.000 --> 19:42.120
<b>Same here!</b>

19:42.120 --> 19:44.750
<b>You helped me learn something
new about myself, too!</b>

19:46.080 --> 19:48.540
<b>Could I get a few photos with you, too?</b>

19:55.080 --> 20:00.410
<b>Senpai, you seem kinda
worked up about Xiaoyu's Liliel.</b>

20:00.410 --> 20:01.330
<b>What?!</b>

20:01.330 --> 20:04.910
<b>No, I'm just nervous! I get shy with strangers!</b>

20:04.910 --> 20:08.750
<b>I know you, so I'm comfortable with you, and...</b>

20:08.950 --> 20:11.080
<b>You're the only Liliel for me!</b>

20:13.250 --> 20:15.950
<b>W-what's that supposed to mean?</b>

20:15.950 --> 20:17.330
<b>I have no idea.</b>

20:17.500 --> 20:20.250
<b>Sorry! Don't worry, I won't steal your boyfriend.</b>

20:20.250 --> 20:23.870
<b>No, that's not what I meant!
And he's not my boyfriend!</b>

20:23.870 --> 20:26.120
<b>Here, get together, I'll take a picture!</b>

20:26.120 --> 20:26.500
<b>Huh?</b>

20:26.500 --> 20:27.580
<b>Closer, c'mon!</b>

20:33.000 --> 20:35.910
<b>You're the cutest couple in all of Japan!</b>

20:38.410 --> 20:40.370
<b>I have to go now.</b>

20:40.660 --> 20:44.750
<b>Thanks so much for today! I'll never forget you!</b>

20:44.950 --> 20:46.080
<b>Same here.</b>

20:46.080 --> 20:48.540
<b>I hope we'll see you again at another event!</b>

20:53.200 --> 20:56.080
<b>Sorry, I can't promise you will.</b>

20:56.080 --> 20:56.700
<b>Huh?</b>

20:58.410 --> 21:03.790
<b>I don't know when I'll be able to come to Japan again.</b>

21:09.000 --> 21:11.500
<b>This country is wonderful.</b>

21:11.500 --> 21:14.290
<b>Everyone can make amazing manga!</b>

21:14.290 --> 21:15.750
<b>Nothing is off-limits!</b>

21:17.250 --> 21:19.000
<b>Take care of Liliel.</b>

21:19.700 --> 21:21.580
<b>And please take care...</b>

21:22.410 --> 21:24.500
<b>...of this wonderful world.</b>

21:28.330 --> 21:30.910
<b>I can't believe Comiket's over.</b>

21:34.910 --> 21:36.290
<b>She's all fired up!</b>

21:38.540 --> 21:40.120
<b>Oh, just...</b>

21:40.790 --> 21:45.330
<b>You put so much energy into
everything for this Comiket.</b>

21:45.330 --> 21:48.200
<b>I was a little worried you'd be
completely drained by the end.</b>

21:48.620 --> 21:49.580
<b>No way!</b>

21:49.580 --> 21:52.250
<b>I'm not gonna waste
a single day from here on out!</b>

21:52.250 --> 21:55.160
<b>The moment I get home,
I'm gonna start brainstorming my next cosplay!</b>

21:55.160 --> 21:56.950
<b>Yeah, sounds good.</b>

22:00.790 --> 22:05.370
<b>My waifu is 2D.
I'm not interested in 3D girls.</b>

22:06.080 --> 22:07.040
<b>But...</b>

22:08.370 --> 22:10.950
<b>2.5D might be okay.</b>

22:13.580 --> 22:16.450
<b>I'm not in love!
I am definitely not in love with her!</b>

22:18.200 --> 22:23.870
<b>But before I realized it,
I had fallen in love with this wonderful world.</b>

23:56.040 --> 24:01.040
<b>Manga Club On the Beach</b>
